# 广告拦截(内置示例规则集)
# 行格式与 clash rules 一致:TYPE,value,policy[,no-resolve]
# 策略建议用 REJECT / DIRECT 这类客户端内置策略,换模板也不会失效。
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,doubleclick.net,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlesyndication.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleadservices.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adservice.google.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pagead2.googlesyndication.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ads.twitter.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,advertising.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adnxs.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adcolony.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,applovin.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,unityads.unity3d.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,app-measurement.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crashlytics.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adjust.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,umeng.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cnzz.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,talkingdata.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,miui.com,REJECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,analytics.126.net,REJECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,-ad-system,REJECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,adserver,REJECT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,adservice,REJECT
